op_ut,third_party.torch-xpu-ops.test.xpu.test_ops_xpu.TestCommonXPU,test_dtypes_nn_functional_conv_transpose3d_xpu

Error:
```
Traceback (most recent call last):
  File "/home/gta/venvs/pytorch_official/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/testing/_internal/common_device_type.py", line 1263, in test_wrapper
    return test(*args, **kwargs)
           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  File "/home/gta/venvs/pytorch_official/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/testing/_internal/common_device_type.py", line 1347, in dep_fn
    return fn(slf, *args, **kwargs)
           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  File "/home/gta/venvs/pytorch_official/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/testing/_internal/common_device_type.py", line 1620, in only_fn
    return fn(self, *args, **kwargs)
           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  File "/home/gta/pytorch/third_party/torch-xpu-ops/test/xpu/../../../../test/test_ops.py", line 1813, in test_dtypes
    self.fail(msg)
  File "/usr/lib/python3.12/unittest/case.py", line 715, in fail
    raise self.failureException(msg)
AssertionError: The supported dtypes for nn.functional.conv_transpose3d on device type xpu are incorrect!
The following dtypes worked in forward but are not listed by the OpInfo: {torch.int8}.
```

Solution:
Add this line in upstream:
`dtypesIfXPU=floating_and_complex_types_and(torch.bfloat16, torch.float16, torch.int8),`
to OpInfo in torch/testing/_internal/common_methods_invocations.py for `nn.functional.conv_transpose2d` and `nn.functional.conv_transpose3d` (lines: 16295 and 16351)

