### 🐛 Describe the bug

Cases:
op_ut,third_party.torch-xpu-ops.test.xpu.dynamo.test_streams_xpu.TestStreams,test_record_stream_problem_basic
op_ut,third_party.torch-xpu-ops.test.xpu.dynamo.test_streams_xpu.TestStreams,test_record_stream_problem_interleaved
