  **Fix Strategy:** Investigate why input.grad is None after backward on XPU in the expanded weights path. The issue likely lies in XPU backward kernels for conv/linear/layernorm not properly handling ExpandedWeight tensors, or in torch/nn/utils/_expanded_weights/ helper functions that may need XPU-specific adjustments. Check if the XPU backward implementations in third_party/torch-xpu-ops/src/ATen/native/xpu/ properly support the per-sample-grad path.

  **Tokens:** model: claude-sonnet-4 | tokens: 128.8K | in: 8 | out: 1.4K | cache_read: 103.6K | cache_write: 23.8K | cost: $0.1421
