  **Summary:** XPU operator dtype support does not align with CUDA. Multiple ops (addmm, addmv, baddbmm, histogram, mv, conv variants, einsum, mm, embedding_bag, linear, matmul, tensordot, bmm, bilinear, linalg_multi_dot, addbmm) fail test_dtypes, test_noncontiguous_samples, test_numpy_ref, and test_multiple_devices checks because XPU does not support the same set of dtypes (e.g. int64, complex32) as CUDA.
